<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA BEAT ENGLISH MIDLANDS 90-24.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA BEAT ENGLISH MIDLANDS 90-24.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHAMPTON, England 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina beat the Midlands 90-24 (halftime 40-17) in rugby union tour match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Midlands - Wayne Kilford (2), Julian Horrobin. Conversions: Jez Harris (3). Penalty: Harris.</p>
<p>Argentina - Tries: Eduardo Simone (4), Diego Giannantonio (3), Carlos Promanzio (2), Diego Albanese, Octavio Bartolucci, Pablo Bouza, Roberto Grau, German Llanes. Conversions: Gonzalo Quesado (10).</p>
